WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.089 --> 00:00:04.520
A man is sitting in a chair inside a containment
cell at the SCP Foundation.

00:00:04.520 --> 00:00:08.600
The man is dressed normally and he isn’t
trying to escape or attack the researchers

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:09.960
who are observing him.

00:00:09.960 --> 00:00:14.670
The only thing that makes this man different
from you or I is that he ages right in front

00:00:14.670 --> 00:00:20.170
of us, going from a teenager to an old man
in a matter of minutes.

00:00:20.170 --> 00:00:26.840
At first glance, SCP-1007 looks very normal,
just a corpse lying in a standard coffin.

00:00:26.840 --> 00:00:31.460
Well, the corpse of an old man in a coffin
being kept locked up in a containment chamber

00:00:31.460 --> 00:00:36.590
is normal when compared to some of the other
strange anomalies that are found in the SCP

00:00:36.590 --> 00:00:38.390
Foundation’s archives.

00:00:38.390 --> 00:00:44.510
Inside the coffin with SCP-1007 is a small
metal key, and this is quite literally the

00:00:44.510 --> 00:00:47.899
key to seeing what makes this anomaly so special.

00:00:47.899 --> 00:00:53.300
On SCP-1007’s back between his shoulder
blades is a small keyhole.

00:00:53.300 --> 00:00:57.860
X-ray scans of 1007 have shown that the keyhole
is just an empty socket.

00:00:57.860 --> 00:01:01.950
It’s unconnected to anything, there’s
no internal clockwork mechanisms or other

00:01:01.950 --> 00:01:05.560
machinery that should be able to be activated
by a key.

00:01:05.560 --> 00:01:13.270
When the metal key that is kept in SCP-1007’s
coffin, classified as SCP-1007-1, is inserted

00:01:13.270 --> 00:01:19.450
into the keyhole on 1007’s back and turned,
something truly incredible happens.

00:01:19.450 --> 00:01:26.189
As the key is turned, SCP-1007 undergoes a
change unlike anything the SCP Foundation

00:01:26.189 --> 00:01:27.939
has seen before.

00:01:27.939 --> 00:01:33.569
With each turn of the key, the subject’s
physical age is reversed by one full year.

00:01:33.569 --> 00:01:39.259
Foundation researchers are able to watch 1007
age in reverse in real time.

00:01:39.259 --> 00:01:44.149
Even any decay that had set in on the corpse
is completely reversed and disappears as the

00:01:44.149 --> 00:01:48.529
key is wound and 1007 gets younger and younger.

00:01:48.529 --> 00:01:54.329
As the key is turned, 1007 will continue to
de-age, physically compacting and shrinking

00:01:54.329 --> 00:01:58.069
down until it appears to have the form of
a newborn human child.

00:01:58.069 --> 00:02:03.109
It’s unknown where the physical mass of
1007’s body goes to, since this should defy

00:02:03.109 --> 00:02:08.399
the laws of physics, but those laws we assume
to be a bedrock of our universe’s reality

00:02:08.399 --> 00:02:15.379
are often more of a suggestion when it comes
to anomalies the SCP Foundation deals with.

00:02:15.379 --> 00:02:20.459
Once SCP-1007 reaches the newborn baby stage,
it will suddenly reactivate, coming to life

00:02:20.459 --> 00:02:24.980
immediately regardless of how long it has
been dead and lying in its coffin.

00:02:24.980 --> 00:02:30.100
Once 1007 is brought back to life, he will
go through the entire human life cycle within

00:02:30.100 --> 00:02:35.380
a seventy-five minute period, experiencing
what looks to be approximately one year of

00:02:35.380 --> 00:02:39.510
normal human growth and development for every
minute that passes.

00:02:39.510 --> 00:02:45.560
That means that in the course of about sixteen
minutes, researchers will see SCP-1007 change

00:02:45.560 --> 00:02:48.760
from a crying infant to a fully grown teenager.

00:02:48.760 --> 00:02:53.170
As you can imagine, the subject has reported
feeling excruciating pain during these first

00:02:53.170 --> 00:02:58.640
few minutes as his bones rapidly lengthen
and expand, and his muscles develop and change

00:02:58.640 --> 00:03:00.180
shape dramatically.

00:03:00.180 --> 00:03:05.959
SCP-1007 is able to watch with his young eyes
as his bones move and set themselves into

00:03:05.959 --> 00:03:10.920
place, lengthening and widening in seconds
during growth spurts that normally take months

00:03:10.920 --> 00:03:12.319
or years.

00:03:12.319 --> 00:03:16.340
After about five minutes, provided his legs
have grown to the same length at the same

00:03:16.340 --> 00:03:20.540
time, he’s usually able to prop himself
up and stand.

00:03:20.540 --> 00:03:24.170
At around ten minutes, the pain really starts.

00:03:24.170 --> 00:03:28.879
The bones crack and ache as they grow at their
fastest for the whole cycle.

00:03:28.879 --> 00:03:32.900
Hair will also grow on his face and body,
and he can’t help but feel some amount of

00:03:32.900 --> 00:03:37.330
shame and embarrassment at what’s happening
to him in front of the Foundation researchers,

00:03:37.330 --> 00:03:39.900
who are taking copious notes.

00:03:39.900 --> 00:03:43.280
By twenty minutes, he can hardly think due
to the pain.

00:03:43.280 --> 00:03:47.599
At this point, he usually lies down and curls
into a ball, whispering to himself that it

00:03:47.599 --> 00:03:51.680
will all be over soon, that the pain won’t
last forever.

00:03:51.680 --> 00:03:53.950
After another ten minutes, he’s right.

00:03:53.950 --> 00:03:58.109
The pain has almost stopped completely by
the thirty minute mark, but now as wrinkles

00:03:58.109 --> 00:04:04.810
and stretch marks start to set in, a different
kind of pain reveals itself as SCP-1007 realizes

00:04:04.810 --> 00:04:07.680
that he must watch himself die.

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:12.180
Forty minutes in and he starts to reflect
on his past, the life he was forced to lead

00:04:12.180 --> 00:04:16.370
as a kind of sideshow freak, more on that
later though.

00:04:16.370 --> 00:04:21.660
The physical decay happens faster now, warts
and moles and other marks of age appearing

00:04:21.660 --> 00:04:22.660
on his skin.

00:04:22.660 --> 00:04:27.020
After fifty minutes he is aware that over
half of his “life” has passed and he is

00:04:27.020 --> 00:04:28.430
reaching the end.

00:04:28.430 --> 00:04:33.270
His hair starts to fall out as do his teeth,
which he’s never actually been able to use

00:04:33.270 --> 00:04:35.830
as he has never tasted food.

00:04:35.830 --> 00:04:41.210
As the sixty minute mark comes and goes, he
begins to feel grateful for the coming end,

00:04:41.210 --> 00:04:44.270
with the escape from pain and the rest it
would bring.

00:04:44.270 --> 00:04:48.590
His body has become very wrinkled by this
point and is covered with age spots.

00:04:48.590 --> 00:04:53.210
His eyes begin to cloud severely limiting
his ability to see and his hearing gets weaker

00:04:53.210 --> 00:04:57.650
and weaker until he can’t comprehend anything
the researchers say.

00:04:57.650 --> 00:05:00.680
At seventy five minutes it’s all over.

00:05:00.680 --> 00:05:05.270
SCP-1007’s body expires and he dies once
again.

00:05:05.270 --> 00:05:09.750
He will remain as a corpse until the metal
key is inserted into his back and the whole

00:05:09.750 --> 00:05:12.389
process starts once again.

00:05:12.389 --> 00:05:17.650
Just as there appears to be no explanation
for where the mass of SCP-1007’s body goes

00:05:17.650 --> 00:05:23.139
as the key is wound during the reversal process,
so too is there no explanation for where the

00:05:23.139 --> 00:05:26.330
energy needed for his rapid growth comes from.

00:05:26.330 --> 00:05:30.770
This process should violate the First Law
of Thermodynamics, and Foundation researchers

00:05:30.770 --> 00:05:34.199
are very curious about the underlying process.

00:05:34.199 --> 00:05:40.270
The one constant that remains on SCP-1007’s
body is a small tattoo on his right calf,

00:05:40.270 --> 00:05:46.340
where the words “Mr. Life and Mr. Death,
from Little Misters ® by Dr. Wondertainment”

00:05:46.340 --> 00:05:47.340
appear.

00:05:47.340 --> 00:05:53.009
This matches up with entry number eleven on
document SCP-909-a which lists a total of

00:05:53.009 --> 00:05:55.110
20 “Little Misters.”

00:05:55.110 --> 00:06:01.330
SCP-1007 was recovered by Task Force Tau-6
during a raid on a mansion in California along

00:06:01.330 --> 00:06:04.669
with several other anomalous creatures and
objects.

00:06:04.669 --> 00:06:10.139
The owner of the mansion claimed that he had
acquired SCP-1007 at an auction hosted by

00:06:10.139 --> 00:06:15.320
Marshall, Carter, and Dark Ltd.
Marshall, Carter, and Dark Ltd. is a “club”

00:06:15.320 --> 00:06:19.790
based in London, England that is famed for
collecting and selling what it would describe

00:06:19.790 --> 00:06:22.669
as “rare and obscure” objects.

00:06:22.669 --> 00:06:26.660
Unfortunately, this often includes various
anomalies that should be under the care of

00:06:26.660 --> 00:06:32.199
the SCP Foundation, and the club’s mission
to provide its members with exclusive, expensive,

00:06:32.199 --> 00:06:37.440
and rare experiences means that they’re
often in conflict with the Foundation, and

00:06:37.440 --> 00:06:40.490
they have even been responsible for several
containment breaches.

00:06:40.490 --> 00:06:45.889
Marshall, Carter, and Dark Ltd. continues
to be a very secretive organization, and the

00:06:45.889 --> 00:06:51.470
name of the director and a list of its members
have so far been very difficult to obtain.

00:06:51.470 --> 00:06:57.470
At the auction they hosted where SCP-1007
was offered for sale, there were apparently,

00:06:57.470 --> 00:07:02.440
along with Mr. Life and Death, at least four
other “Misters” for sale though the identity

00:07:02.440 --> 00:07:08.509
of the other buyers and which Little Misters
they may have purchased is still under investigation.

00:07:08.509 --> 00:07:15.409
The fact that SCP-1007 has the name Mr. Life
AND Mr. Death seems to imply that he may have

00:07:15.409 --> 00:07:20.250
originally been part of a set, though this
counterpart Little Mister has yet to be recovered

00:07:20.250 --> 00:07:22.319
or even identified.

00:07:22.319 --> 00:07:27.600
In interviews with SCP-1007, he has given
his own personal theory that he embodies both

00:07:27.600 --> 00:07:32.230
names, and the designation is a reference
to the way he alternates between life and

00:07:32.230 --> 00:07:33.230
death.

00:07:33.230 --> 00:07:38.220
However, the possibility still remains though
that he may have a twin of sorts, and the

00:07:38.220 --> 00:07:43.419
Foundation continues to investigate its possible
identity and location.

00:07:43.419 --> 00:07:49.039
SCP-1007’s brief seventy five minute life
followed by a death that lasts until he is

00:07:49.039 --> 00:07:54.580
rewound by his special key means that he is
easily contained and has been classified as

00:07:54.580 --> 00:07:55.580
“safe.”

00:07:55.580 --> 00:08:00.069
He is only to be activated during routine
testing and after experiencing death, he is

00:08:00.069 --> 00:08:03.130
to be placed back into his coffin along with
the key.

00:08:03.130 --> 00:08:07.889
In keeping with current regulations for all
anomalies that have been designated as “Misters”,

00:08:07.889 --> 00:08:14.750
SCP-1007 is to be contained in Hall 8 of Site
13 for additional observation and study.

00:08:14.750 --> 00:08:22.479
Now go watch SCP-3008 - Trapped in Ikea or
SCP-5000 The Suit for more explanations of

00:08:22.479 --> 00:08:25.379
the strangest anomalies the SCP Foundation
deals with.

